      "content": "Yes, hidden ductwork issues in the walls, such as disconnected or collapsed sections, can severely restrict airflow to that specific bedroom. You should hire a professional for a ducting inspection using a video camera or specialized testing equipment to locate these blockages. Fixing a leak in the return duct or an improperly sized duct run is often the solution to this kind of spot cooling failure.",
      "source": "target",
